1
00:00:00,203 --> 00:00:03,926
Before studying abroad, every student faces the same question:

2
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:05,639
can I afford the whole journey?

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,079
This is StudyFlow.

4
00:00:07,703 --> 00:00:11,048
Your first answer brings tuition, living costs and essential

5
00:00:11,048 --> 00:00:13,289
expenses into one full-course total.

6
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:16,365
Each line distinguishes sourced fees from estimates, so you

7
00:00:16,365 --> 00:00:18,109
can see what the total depends on.

8
00:00:18,345 --> 00:00:21,608
With four universities side by side, course length and

9
00:00:21,608 --> 00:00:23,873
total cost become easier to compare.

10
00:00:24,108 --> 00:00:27,600
The same comparison is available in Thai baht and Chinese yuan,

11
00:00:27,615 --> 00:00:30,482
or US dollars, using reference exchange rates.

12
00:00:31,103 --> 00:00:34,332
Your declared savings carry into a saved plan, making

13
00:00:34,332 --> 00:00:35,497
the funding gap clear.

14
00:00:35,738 --> 00:00:38,673
The borrowing ceiling is simulated, not a bank offer.

15
00:00:38,909 --> 00:00:43,048
If an assumption changes, updating one fee revises the estimate.

16
00:00:43,284 --> 00:00:47,099
The forecast then connects those costs to payment dates and sources.

17
00:00:47,335 --> 00:00:50,217
For the gap that remains, custom and commercial loan

18
00:00:50,217 --> 00:00:52,423
examples show different repayment paths.

19
00:00:52,659 --> 00:00:56,347
One defers principal during study, with the full schedule available.

20
00:00:56,603 --> 00:00:59,779
Here, we choose twenty thousand baht over sixty months,

21
00:00:59,989 --> 00:01:02,693
with principal and interest paid from the start.

22
00:01:03,337 --> 00:01:06,022
Once the student confirms the plan, it becomes a

23
00:01:06,022 --> 00:01:07,708
simulated loan application.

24
00:01:07,948 --> 00:01:10,270
The checklist records demo declarations;

25
00:01:10,494 --> 00:01:12,585
it does not verify uploaded documents.

26
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:16,925
A separate signing step makes consent and the school recipient explicit.

27
00:01:17,161 --> 00:01:20,020
The signed agreement schedules payments directly to the school's

28
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:24,244
account, verified within this simulation, without adding loan funds

29
00:01:24,244 --> 00:01:25,501
to the student's wallet.

30
00:01:26,137 --> 00:01:28,621
Family support covers another part of the plan:

31
00:01:29,007 --> 00:01:30,102
first-month housing.

32
00:01:30,343 --> 00:01:32,634
A private link lets a family member confirm the

33
00:01:32,634 --> 00:01:35,292
promise, while the wallet stays unchanged.

34
00:01:35,547 --> 00:01:38,585
Only when the operator records a simulated receipt does

35
00:01:38,585 --> 00:01:41,302
the wallet gain six thousand five hundred baht.

36
00:01:41,970 --> 00:01:44,362
Preparation stays in the same conversation.

37
00:01:44,602 --> 00:01:47,792
A dated reminder can be acknowledged, then completed.

38
00:01:48,028 --> 00:01:52,248
When registration is finished, the student explicitly confirms enrollment.

39
00:01:52,484 --> 00:01:54,262
That opens daily-life tools;

40
00:01:54,544 --> 00:01:57,711
the date alone neither enrolls the student nor pays a bill.

41
00:01:58,343 --> 00:02:01,158
A monthly budget of six thousand baht keeps upcoming

42
00:02:01,158 --> 00:02:03,056
payments and shortfalls in view.

43
00:02:03,312 --> 00:02:05,530
Just tell StudyFlow what you spent on lunch.

44
00:02:05,766 --> 00:02:08,760
It records the expense and updates your remaining budget.

45
00:02:08,995 --> 00:02:09,905
Made a mistake?

46
00:02:10,141 --> 00:02:12,683
Undoing the entry restores the budget immediately.

47
00:02:13,303 --> 00:02:16,459
Separate currency balances make spending easier to follow.

48
00:02:16,699 --> 00:02:20,121
All funds shown here come from simulated top-ups and receipts.

49
00:02:20,357 --> 00:02:23,655
For an exchange, the assistant compares quotes and prepares

50
00:02:23,655 --> 00:02:25,723
a proposal, awaiting your approval.

51
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:29,936
A wrong password stops the action and leaves balances unchanged.

52
00:02:30,191 --> 00:02:33,899
With the correct password and confirmation, five hundred yuan

53
00:02:33,899 --> 00:02:35,326
is converted into baht.

54
00:02:35,579 --> 00:02:37,785
The same principle applies to remittances:

55
00:02:38,090 --> 00:02:41,906
routes, fees and arrival estimates come before commitment.

56
00:02:42,141 --> 00:02:45,509
Once confirmed, the transfer debits the source balance and

57
00:02:45,509 --> 00:02:47,172
creates an order you can track.

58
00:02:47,803 --> 00:02:50,558
When tuition is due, the Pay tab separates your

59
00:02:50,558 --> 00:02:52,498
own bills from those covered by the loan.

60
00:02:52,739 --> 00:02:55,412
A visible shortfall leads to a top-up for exactly

61
00:02:55,412 --> 00:02:56,345
the missing amount.

62
00:02:56,581 --> 00:03:00,119
Reviewing the payee and entering the password authorizes payment.

63
00:03:00,354 --> 00:03:02,982
The bill is marked paid, while a loan-covered bill

64
00:03:02,982 --> 00:03:05,223
is protected against a duplicate charge.

65
00:03:05,837 --> 00:03:08,205
Repayment follows the same consent flow.

66
00:03:08,445 --> 00:03:11,293
We advance the demo date, then authorize the first

67
00:03:11,293 --> 00:03:12,782
installment with a password.

68
00:03:13,017 --> 00:03:15,513
The paid installment appears in the loan history.

69
00:03:15,764 --> 00:03:19,199
For smaller bills, the fixed demo credit line provides

70
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:21,432
funds repayable within thirty days.

71
00:03:21,686 --> 00:03:25,802
Repaying that credit requires a password and debits the simulated wallet.

72
00:03:26,038 --> 00:03:28,770
The available line is restored, with an on-time record

73
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:30,559
when repayment meets the due date.

74
00:03:31,170 --> 00:03:33,272
These safeguards also set boundaries.

75
00:03:33,513 --> 00:03:37,158
An over-limit transfer is blocked without operator approval, even

76
00:03:37,158 --> 00:03:38,427
with the correct password.

77
00:03:38,663 --> 00:03:42,212
The audit trail records authorization attempts and completed actions.

78
00:03:42,448 --> 00:03:46,580
Eligible payments build StudyFlow's internal on-time record, rather than

79
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:47,988
an external credit score.

80
00:03:48,223 --> 00:03:50,318
A signed statement can be checked by a separate

81
00:03:50,318 --> 00:03:51,738
visitor without logging in.

82
00:03:51,973 --> 00:03:54,492
Changing its contents makes verification fail.

83
00:03:55,137 --> 00:03:58,736
From the first cost comparison to student life, StudyFlow

84
00:03:58,736 --> 00:04:00,179
keeps decisions connected:

85
00:04:00,461 --> 00:04:04,913
live AI proposes, the server enforces, and the student authorizes.
